<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Land transfers S$120mln assets to RHL.</title>
<headline>DBS Land transfers S$120mln assets to RHL.</headline>
<text>
<p>SINGAPORE, Feb 26 (REUTER) - DBS Land is transferring Singapore $120 million worth of assets to its subsidiary Raffles Holdings (1995) Ptd Ltd (RHL), state television said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The assets include Raffles Centre Ltd, Raffles International and Stamford hotel.</p>
<p>In return for the assets, RHL will issue 94 million shares at a price of S$1.29 per share to DBS Land.</p>
<p>RHL is expected to be listed later this year.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (+65-870-3093)</p>
</text>
